Real Firebase config goes here.

1. In the Firebase console, register an Android app with applicationId
   "com.hackmit.twins" (matches app/build.gradle.kts defaultConfig.applicationId).
2. Download the generated google-services.json.
3. Place it at: android/app/google-services.json  (sibling of this file, NOT
   this file itself — this .TODO file is just a placeholder so the expected
   path shows up in the repo; it is not valid JSON and the Gradle build will
   fail until the real file is dropped in).
4. Enable in the Firebase console: Anonymous Auth (Authentication > Sign-in
   method), Firestore, Cloud Functions, and Cloud Messaging.
